<section class="section_featured"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-section-large no-padding-top"><div class="featured_component"><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Our top-selling roof conversions</h2><div id="w-node-f8692adc-3538-4a80-bdc9-8c5234dd1bb8-439371a6" class="featured_header-right"><div class="button-group"><Button href="/services" label="View all products" variant="brand" size="small" icon={false} /></div></div><div id="w-node-_00dcdce4-34f0-d7a1-8254-9ca67f052650-439371a6" class="product-benefits_wrap"><div class="product-benefits_trim"><div class="product-benefits_cms_wrap swiper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="product-benefits_cms_list swiper-wrapper w-dyn-items">
<div role="listitem" class="product-benefits_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="products_card"><a tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/services/volkswagen-t5-t6-swb" class="products_link w-inline-block"></a><div class="products_image-wrap"><div class="products_badge-wrap"><div class="badge is-white is-shadow"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-richtext"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7" fill="#A3D346"/><path d="M4.5 7.5L6.5 9.5 10.5 5.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div><div>Volkswagen</div></div></div><img src="images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-500.webp 500w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-800.webp 800w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-1080.webp 1080w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-1600.webp 1600w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n-p-2000.webp 2000w, images/6789401358c5da7323f77af1_317495482_1354444885323970_4977928054262553334_n.webp 2048w" class="products_image"/></div><div class="products_info-wrap"><div class="products_content-link-wrap"><div class="text-size-small">Elevated Roof</div><div class="products_header-wrap"><h2 class="heading-style-h6">T5 &amp; T6 SWB</h2></div></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-light text-style-3lines w-richtext"><p>The Volkswagen Transporter T5 and T6 short-wheelbase models are popular choices for campervan conversions, offering a good balance of size and manoeuvrability. It's what makes them one of the most common sights across campsites and green spaces throughout the UK and Europe. Now, you can maximise the interior space of your SWB Transporter even further with a Skyrule Volkswagen T5 &amp; T6 SWB front elevating roof conversion, creating a comfortable and versatile living area with invaluable extra headroom when needed.</p></div></div><div data-theme="dark" class="products_button-wrap"><Button href="/services/volkswagen-t5-t6-swb" label="View Product" variant="primary" size="small" layout="normal" /></div></div></div>
<div role="listitem" class="product-benefits_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="products_card"><a tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/services/volkswagen-t5-t6-lwb" class="products_link w-inline-block"></a><div class="products_image-wrap"><div class="products_badge-wrap"><div class="badge is-white is-shadow"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-richtext"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7" fill="#A3D346"/><path d="M4.5 7.5L6.5 9.5 10.5 5.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div><div>Volkswagen</div></div></div><img src="images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-500.webp 500w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-800.webp 800w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-1080.webp 1080w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n-p-1600.webp 1600w, images/6789387674916c6d949637d5_334961135_505410005083682_7112766069890933532_n.webp 2048w" class="products_image"/></div><div class="products_info-wrap"><div class="products_content-link-wrap"><div class="text-size-small">Elevated Roof</div><div class="products_header-wrap"><h2 class="heading-style-h6">T5 &amp; T6 LWB</h2></div></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-light text-style-3lines w-richtext"><p>The Volkswagen Transporter T5 and T6 models are some of the most popular base vehicles for camper van conversion — both readily customisable and highly versatile vehicles, and if you have the long wheelbase variant, there's even more you can do with the extended interior space. We've been fans of the Transporter since the early models — and we've developed our front-elevating roof to make the most of the T5 and T6's potential.</p></div></div><div data-theme="dark" class="products_button-wrap"><Button href="/services/volkswagen-t5-t6-lwb" label="View Product" variant="primary" size="small" layout="normal" /></div></div></div>
<div role="listitem" class="product-benefits_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="products_card"><a tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" href="/services/ford-transit-custom-swb" class="products_link w-inline-block"></a><div class="products_image-wrap"><div class="products_badge-wrap"><div class="badge is-white is-shadow"><div class="icon-embed-xxsmall w-richtext"><div class="w-embed"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none"><circle cx="7.5" cy="7.5" r="7" fill="#A3D346"/><path d="M4.5 7.5L6.5 9.5 10.5 5.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div></div><div>Ford</div></div></div><img src="images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n-p-500.webp 500w, images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n-p-800.webp 800w, images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n-p-1080.webp 1080w, images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n-p-1600.webp 1600w, images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n-p-2000.webp 2000w, images/6786a0bf2a7d77fa022f21bf_58926219_1292806637560794_4946551669170110464_n.webp 2048w" class="products_image"/></div><div class="products_info-wrap"><div class="products_content-link-wrap"><div class="text-size-small">Elevated Roof</div><div class="products_header-wrap"><h2 class="heading-style-h6">Transit Custom SWB</h2></div></div><div class="text-size-small text-weight-light text-style-3lines w-richtext"><p>The Ford Transit Custom SWB is a popular and versatile choice for campervan conversions, offering a balance of practicality and style. With a little less interior space to play with than its long wheelbase cousin, making the most of what's available really counts. A Skyrule Ford Transit Custom front elevating roof conversion will significantly enhance the interior space and comfort of your campervan, making it ideal for both everyday use and longer multi-week adventures. Suitable for all models including the 2024+ new shape.</p></div></div><div data-theme="dark" class="products_button-wrap"><Button href="/services/ford-transit-custom-swb" label="View Product" variant="primary" size="small" layout="normal" /></div></div></div>
